# Play test of The Frontier (CIPlay the_frontier, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the harbour's quay
# (deck 2.6 m) out over the basin, the lower town on the shelf (2.5 m): the harbour office, the square, the forge and its
# yard; the net store sunk off the quay's end (6 m down); the road up the north face - the first ramp from the east shelf
# to the lower terrace (12.5 m), the second to the middle terrace (23.6 m), the third to the mesa (34.7 m); the upper town:
# the reservoir, the farm store, the grower's house and the goat pen, the builders' tower (top deck 44.5 m), the archive,
# the horn's tower (top deck 39.6 m), the Corps' hall; the lift behind it down to the cove (2.5 m) and the vault sunk in
# the cove (5 m down).
island The Frontier
expect step 0
expect title Almost Home
wait 5
# (the island's friendly animals as it arrives: hens in the lower town and by the grower's house, turtles in the harbour,
# dolphins off the north shore - checked here, not at the end: in a long story sea creatures don't always last)
expect animals Chicken 5
expect animals Turtle 2
expect animals Dolphin 2

# Chapter 1 - arrival: along the quay to the shelf, the welcome board, the harbour office, the square
walk 4 91 to 0 96 to 0 118.75 h=2.6
zone harbour
expect step 1
walk 0 118.75 to 0 96 to 4 91.5 h=2.5
read Welcome board
expect step 2
walk 4 91.5 to -12 88 to -15 86.25 to -18.5 86.25 h=2.6 below=5
open Harbour office locker
expect step 3
walk -14 87.5 to 6 89 to 22 89 to 28 86 h=2.5
zone square
expect step 4

# Chapter 2 - the lower town: the smith's note in the forge, the dogs in its yard, the netmaker's note on the quay, the
# dive for the smiths' key, the forge chest
walk 28 86 to 50 86 to 72 84 to 82 76 to 80 68 to 66 68 to 62 66 to 61.75 61.5 h=2.6 below=5
read Smith's note
expect step 5
walk 61.75 61.5 to 63 61.75 to 67 61.5 to 72 59 h=2.5 below=5
zone forgeyard
kill Hyena
expect step 6
walk 2 92 to 0 96 to 0 106 h=2.6
read Netmaker's note
expect step 7
at 7 134.6 h=-4.6
open Net store crate
expect story wardenkey 1
expect step 8
at 61 62.5 h=3.8
open Forge chest
expect story wardenkey 0
expect story hornreed 1
expect step 9

# Chapter 3 - the farms' water: up the road - the first ramp, across the lower terrace, the second ramp, across the middle
# terrace, the third ramp onto the mesa - opening the terraces' crates on the way; the reservoir, its bear and note, the
# sluice, the farm store
walk 68 69 to 72 74 to 56 75 to 38 75 to 30 74.6 h=12.5
open Lower terrace crate
walk 30 74.6 to 4 74.6 to 1 70 h=12.5
walk 1 70 to -2 66.4 to -20 66.4 to -31 65 h=23.6
walk -31 64 to -27 56 to -6 54.6 to 2 53 h=23.6
open Middle terrace crate
walk 2 53 to 20 51.4 to 35 51 to 38 46 to 37 38 h=34.7
open Upper terrace crate
expect story valvewheel 3
walk 37 38 to 32 30 to 2 29 to -10 31.5 h=34.7
zone reservoir
expect step 10
kill Bear
expect step 11
read Reservoir keeper's note
expect step 13
expect hidden wheels
use sluice
expect message thunders down the pipe
expect shown wheels
expect story valvewheel 0
expect story waterpass 1
expect step 14
walk -10 31.5 to -3.75 28.5 to -3.75 24 h=34.8 below=37
open Farm store
expect story seal 1
expect step 15

# Chapter 4 - the upper town: the grower's note, the goats, the grower's chest; the builder's board, up the builders'
# tower, the seal press; the archive and its seal
walk -3.75 28.5 to -26 26 to -37.75 25.5 to -37.75 28.5 h=34.8 below=37
read Grower's note
expect step 16
open Net box
expect item NetGun 1
catch Goat 2
expect step 17
open Grower's chest
expect step 18
walk -37.75 25 to -26 24 to -20 19 to 0 17 to 12.5 17.5 h=34.7
read Builder's note
expect step 19
climb 16.75 17.38 h=34.8
expect stand 17.25 18.75 h=37.22 below=39
at 18.25 16.75 h=45.6
where
expect stand 18.25 16.75 h=44.48 below=46
zone buildertop
expect step 20
at 18.25 16.75 h=45.6
reach Builders' tower crate
open Builders' tower crate
expect story sealtool 1
expect step 21
walk 14 15 to 26 15 to 29 16.25 to 30.9 16.25 h=34.8 below=37
zone archive
expect step 22
use archivepress
expect story sealtool 0
expect story seal 2
expect step 23

# Chapter 5 - the hall: its doors and plaque, the signal horn on its tower, the doors opened with the three seals, the
# commander's last order
walk 28 16.25 to 28 12 to 40 12 to 46 7.75 h=34.7
zone hall
expect step 24
read Hall door plaque
expect step 25
climb 40.75 17.38 h=34.8
expect stand 41.25 18.75 h=37.22 below=39
at 41.6 17.4 h=40.7
use horn
expect message long, long, short
expect story hornreed 0
expect story seal 3
expect step 26
at 46 7 h=35.8
walk 46 7.75 to 51.5 7.75 blocked
use halldoor
expect story seal 0
wait 3
walk 46 7.75 to 49 7.75 to 52 7.75 h=34.8 below=40
zone hallinside
expect step 27
read Commander's last order
expect step 28

# Chapter 6 - the end: out of the hall's back door onto the lift's platform, the lift down to the cove, the dive to the
# vault, the angler, the vault (and the lift back up)
walk 52 7.75 to 52 9 to 56.5 9 to 57.2 7.75 to 60.5 7.75 h=34.8 below=37
use liftdown
expect message stops at the cove
expect step 29
at 86 7.5 h=-3.6
zone vault
expect step 30
kill Stingray
expect step 31
open Corps' vault
expect shown halllights
expect done
at 72 7.5 h=3.6
use liftup
expect message stops behind the hall
